		(uuid "3542d22f-44e0-41e0-b3e3-b3e69ec7802e")
	)
	(text "All resistors must be 1%\n\nFB = VSETx = Vref(R2/(R1+R2)), where Vref=2V0\nFor 3V3, tie Vset to 2V0 and use PD on FB\nL = (Vin - Vout)(Vout/Vin)/(0.3I * fsw)\n\nCompensation network assumes maximum current draw on each channel\ndue to the unpredictable FPGA current draw\n\nPower Sequence 1V0 @ 0ms, 1V8 @ 6ms, 1V35 @ 12ms, 3V3 @ 12ms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 181.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4295a21a-c83c-441e-a152-3a6670000156")
	)
	(text "ToDo: \nValidate component values\nValidate power up sequence"
